Hi {Owner},

I build websites for accounting firms around {City}. {Business Name} has a strong reputation, but the site lists every service on one page and asks clients to email their documents, so the advisory work and the secure portal are easy to miss.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: pages for each client type, a filing deadline calendar, a secure portal guide, an advisory and outsourced finance section and careers for graduates and experienced hires, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, deadline updates and changes. The partners approve every page before launch. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth twenty minutes before busy season?

{Your Name}
